  "body": "From the moment you step inside, this stunning single-level home leaves a lasting impression. The motivated owners are keen to move onto their next chapter!\r\n\r\nOriginally built by a builder as his own forever home in 2021, the property reflects a commitment to quality construction and attention to detail. From the premium materials and finishes to the practical design, the focus was on creating a home that prioritises quality, durability, and timeless style.\r\n\r\nThe designer kitchen is a standout feature, combining bespoke cabinetry with integrated fridge and freezer appliances, generous storage, and excellent preparation space. It connects naturally with the dining and living areas, creating a functional hub for everyday living and entertaining.\r\n\r\nLarge sliding doors open the living and dining spaces onto a north-facing deck, creating an easy connection between indoors and out. Whether entertaining, enjoying a morning coffee, or relaxing in the evening, the deck is perfectly positioned to capture all-day sun and uninterrupted views across to the Marina.\r\n\r\nThe bedroom wing is separated from the living areas, providing privacy while maintaining good flow throughout the home. The master suite includes a well-appointed ensuite and generous wardrobe, while the remaining 3 bedrooms and 1.5 bathroom offer flexibility for family living, guests, working from home, or an additional living space.  \r\n\r\nA standout feature is the privacy the home offers; unlike many properties on the street, the main living spaces don't look directly into neighbouring homes, creating a greater sense of seclusion.\r\n\r\nPositioned at the end of a quiet cul-de-sac, it enjoys an elevated setting that maximises natural light and views. With a double garage, off-street parking, and a fenced section ripe for further landscaping for the kids to play, this home ticks all the boxes.\r\n\r\nEvery detail has been considered, from the quality finishes and excellent storage to the practical floor plan. Combining thoughtful design, quality construction, and an elevated position, this home delivers comfortable, contemporary living without compromise.\r\n\r\nCall now to view.",
